    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is about making precise, quick actions and smart decisions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 77 unique levels. I have squeezed all the juice out of this game concept and continue to polish it, making each level more complex and interesting to solve. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Levels are not about waiting, but about running, spinning, taking risks and destroying. The density of gaming situations will not let you get bored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All office furniture is destroyable, but be smart, because it also serves as a kind of protection for co-workers from dragon heartburn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everything will fly away in your path and funky music will not let you get bored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't harm dragon's co-workers with his heartburn! Otherwise you will have to start the level over again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~3 hours to complete the game (depends on skill).  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is about making precise, quick actions and smart decisions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 77 unique levels. I have squeezed all the juice out of this game concept and continue to polish it, making each level more complex and interesting to solve. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Levels are not about waiting, but about running, spinning, taking risks and destroying. The density of gaming situations will not let you get bored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All office furniture is destroyable, but be smart, because it also serves as a kind of protection for co-workers from dragon heartburn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everything will fly away in your path and funky music will not let you get bored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't harm dragon's co-workers with his heartburn! Otherwise you will have to start the level over again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~3 hours to complete the game (depends on skill).  </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "That pizza at lunch was a mistake... Dragon Heartburn is a mix of a top-down shooter and a puzzle game. The dragon gets heartburn in the middle of the workday and needs to get to the infirmary without harming his co-workers!",
